19479,"Urgent Help
My dear, I know that this mail may come as a surprise to you, but then it is for good. I am Mrs Mariam Mustapha the wife of late Dr Mustapha of Iraq who was unto hisassaisination five months ago served as the ambassador of Iraq to noted'voice. My late husband had a fix deposit of three million, eight hundred thousandus-dollars in a bank herein Abidjan cote voice before his untimely death. And I am the next of kin of the money. I am in the hospital for the past four months now because of the shock Received from the news of my husband's death. Now the Dr is saying that therein no hope for me because I am not responding to treatment at all. This is the reason why I want to appoint someone as the beneficiary of the three million eight hundred dollars so that if I eventually survive, the beneficiary will now give me 70% of the money and take 30% commission. But if not, God will take the glory. What I want you to do is to confirm your acceptance to this proposal so that Will give you the details of the bank and the account officer so that you will have to contact him and ask him how the fund will be transferred to your account in your country. I have already informed the account officer that the money will be transferred to the account of my foreign partner who will contact him as soon as possible. Please get back to me for further details and immediate transfer of the funds to your account. Expecting your urgent reply Best RegardsMariam Mustapha",i04,Content Access,"GENERAL SETTINGS
