784,"Meet Julian Support MP on Friday 13th December
38 Degrees Dear Richard, Great news, our petition to fix or scrap the gagging law has nearly 200,000 signatures on it already! Now a 38 Degrees member in Cambridge has made an appointment with Julian Support MP to hand in a copy of the petition. Are you free to join them? If we can make sure that MPs know how much opposition there is to the law, we can pressure the government to fix or scrap it when it comes back to the House of Commons. It will embolden MPs who are already on side, and help keep the pressure up on those who aren&rsquo;t yet. Meeting up with your MP will have a huge impact on them, and could help persuade them to do the right thing and protect freedom of speech. Can you make it to the petition hand in? The details are as follows: 4.45pmFriday 13th December Guildhall, Room 2 Market SquareCB2 3QJOther details: The organizer has indicated that only 6 people can come into the office, but more people will be able to remain outside for a photo. Please click here and fill out your postcode to sign up to the hand-in: https://secure.38degrees.org.uk/gagging-law-petition-hand-inYou don&rsquo;t have to be an expert on the gagging law to meet your MP. It&rsquo;s their job to represent you in parliament, so your opinion will be important to them. Coming along will not only be a great way of standing up for freedom of speech, it will also be a great opportunity to meet other 38 Degrees members who live near you. Can you make it? If so please click here and fill out your postcode to sign up to the event.https://secure.38degrees.org.uk/gagging-law-petition-hand-in Thanks for being involved Robin, James, Jaime and the 38 Degrees team PS: The more of us that sign the petition, the more impact it will have when members hand it in to your MP. If you&rsquo;ve not signed the petition already you can do so here:https://secure.38degrees.org.uk/scrap-the-gagging-law 38 Degrees is funded entirely by donations from thousands of members across the UK. Making a regular donation will mean 38 Degrees can stay independent and plan for future campaigns. Please will you chip in a few pounds a week? https://secure.38degrees.org.uk/start-a-direct-debit Unsubscribe: If you no longer wish to be part of our movement and receive our emails you can unsubscribe here. This email was sent to richard@highwayman.com. 38 DEGREES Registered Company No. 6642193",i04,Content Access,"GENERAL SETTINGS
